<!--
	KuwantimaPrimaryTheme.axaml
	═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
	Entry point for the Kuwantima design system.  One StyleInclude in your
	App.axaml is all that's needed to apply the full theme:

	VERSION HISTORY:
	  1.4.2  2026-09-23  Documentation only — corrects 1.4.1, which was never compiled
	         • 1.4.1's sidebar guide came from the working sandbox but did not work as printed;
	           every snippet is now built and run in a fresh app against the published package
	         • NavPage.IsSelected must be observable — as printed, the nav highlight stuck on the
	           first page while the content changed, with no exception and no binding error
	         • Said outright that the nav button takes its icon from Tag and its label from Content
	         • Documented the 13 shipped Icon.* keys for the first time; the old snippet named one
	           that does not exist, and a missing key renders nothing rather than failing loudly
	  1.4.1  2026-09-23  Documentation only — no selector, setter or resource key changed
	         • README now documents wiring the sidebar to pages: one list drives both the nav
	           buttons and the content area, and Func<Control> is where a DI container plugs in
	         • The only edit to a packaged file is this comment block
	  1.4.0  2026-09-23  The previewers work — for the first time since 1.0.0
	         • Each style file's Design.PreviewWith now carries its own FluentTheme and a
	           ResourceInclude of KuwantimaThemeResources; previewed alone it resolved NOTHING
	           (13/13 keys missing on Button) and failed silently, rendering bare controls
	         • The library gained a Debug-only entry point: the previewer execs the assembly and
	           asks it for an AppBuilder, and a class library has none — it could never start
	         • Stopped double-declaring the style files as AvaloniaResource; Avalonia already
	           includes them as AvaloniaXaml with SubType="Designer", which is what VS previews
	         • Added Invariant_7: every preview must resolve every key it consumes, BOTH variants
	         • Consumer-visible runtime behaviour is UNCHANGED — Design.PreviewWith is designer-only
	  1.3.0  2026-09-22  The accent re-ramp — light text on accent, and the contrast guard
	         • Accent ramp now runs ONE way (darker on interaction): #0078D4 → SystemAccentColorDark1
	           → SystemAccentColorDark2, so a single light ink clears AA on every state (4.53/7.32/10.50)
	         • AccentButtonForeground flipped Black → White; 12 hover backgrounds re-ramped across
	           CheckBox, RadioButton, ToggleButton, MenuToggleButton, ComboBox, ListBox and the Slider
	         • Orange moved off the pressed FILL onto the edge — border plus new KuwantimaAccentGlowPressed
	         • Fixed the Dark hover brush: a 50% light wash put EVERY hovered control at 3.25:1 (now 6.94)
	         • Overrode Fluent's muted text keys — they failed AA on glass and on hovered controls
	         • TabControl / Expander selected+hover fixed: their ink inverts per variant, Light3 does not,
	           so Dark measured 1.43:1 while Light looked fine at 9.70
	         • Added Invariant_6: every ink/surface pair ≥ 4.5:1 under BOTH variants, translucent
	           surfaces composited over their real backdrop
	         • Avalonia 12.1.0 → 12.1.3 (needs Assembly.Load in the test harness — Kuwantima has no
	           C#, so nothing otherwise loads the assembly and avares URIs stop resolving)
	  1.2.0  2026-07-14  Avalonia 12.1.0
	         • Avalonia 12.0.1 → 12.1.0 — restores the XAML previewer (12.0.0 dropped the
	           Design.PreviewWith(Control) overload, so every style file's preview errored)
	         • Removed the dead Avalonia.Diagnostics reference from the sandbox
	         • Migrated the accent / secondary / tertiary text brushes off the WinUI FillColor keys
	           Avalonia 12's Fluent no longer ships (they resolved to nothing since 1.1.0)
	         • Pinned AccentButtonForeground — accent-on-accent text now passes WCAG AA on every state
	         • Added Invariant_5: every consumed resource key must resolve under both themes

	  1.1.0  2026-04-14  Avalonia 12 upgrade
	         • Avalonia 11.3.11 → 12.0.1
	         • Avalonia.Themes.Fluent 11.3.11 → 12.0.1
	         • CommunityToolkit.Mvvm 8.2.1 → 8.4.2
	         • TextBox.Watermark → PlaceholderText (Avalonia 12 rename)
	         • Removed obsolete BindingPlugins / DataAnnotationsValidationPlugin workaround

	  1.0.0  2025-03-11  Initial release
	         • 15 styled controls (Button, CheckBox, ComboBox, Expander,
	           GlassBorder, GridSplitter, ListBox, MenuToggleButton,
	           ProgressBar, RadioButton, Slider, TabControl, TextBox,
	           ToggleButton, ToolTip) + StreamIcons
	         • Classic variants for CheckBox and RadioButton
	         • Accent variant for Button
	         • GridSplitter variants: Pill, Arrow (horizontal + vertical)
	         • Full Fluent palette override (28 tokens, Light + Dark)
	         • Glass-glow border/shadow system
	         • Tooltip, Splitter, and semantic status theme resources
	         • Fluent brush integration (accent foreground, secondary/tertiary text)
	         • Cursor="Hand" on interactive toggle controls

		<StyleInclude Source="avares://Kuwantima/Theme/KuwantimaPrimaryTheme.axaml"/>

	LOAD ORDER (order matters — later entries can override earlier ones):
	  1. Merged resources  — icons + KuwantimaThemeResources (custom brushes)
	  2. Control styles    — Kuwantima-classed templates for 15 controls
	  3. Fluent palette    — ColorPaletteResources that tint the entire Fluent
	                         base with MidnightBlue / AliceBlue
	  4. Global defaults   — PathIcon sizing

	COLOR PHILOSOPHY:
	  • Cool anchor:  MidnightBlue (#191970) / AliceBlue (#F0F8FF)
	    – Provides the blue-ink / icy-frost tint that flows through every
	      Base*, Chrome*, Alt*, and List* Fluent token.
	  • Warm accent:  Orange (#FF8C00 light / #FFA500 dark)
	    – Used for checked/selected borders (KuwantimaAccentOrangeBrush).
	    – Contrasts intentionally against the cool blue to draw attention.
	  • System accent: #0078D4 (Fluent blue)
	    – Drives filled accent backgrounds (buttons, checks, selections).
	  • Together: cool structure + warm signal + blue action.

	FLUENT INTEGRATION:
	  Several Kuwantima brushes were replaced by their Fluent equivalents so
	  they automatically track system accent and high-contrast changes:
	    KuwantimaAccentForeground   → AccentButtonForeground
	    KuwantimaSecondaryTextBrush → SystemControlForegroundBaseMediumHighBrush
	    KuwantimaSubtitleTextBrush  → SystemControlForegroundBaseMediumBrush
	  These can be reclaimed by redefining the Fluent keys in
	  KuwantimaThemeResources.axaml if you need to diverge.

	  Those targets are NOT the ones this comment named until v1.2.0. It pointed at
	  TextOnAccentFillColorPrimaryBrush / TextFillColor{Secondary,Tertiary}Brush —
	  WinUI "FillColor" keys that Avalonia 11's Fluent shipped and Avalonia 12's does
	  not. An unresolvable DynamicResource is silent: no throw, no build error, the
	  setter simply never applies. So from v1.1.0 (the Avalonia 12 upgrade) until
	  v1.2.0 every accent control rendered black-on-blue and nothing reported it.
	  InvariantTests.Invariant_5_every_consumed_resource_key_resolves now fails if any
	  key this library consumes stops resolving. Do not swap these for a key you have
	  not probed — Application.Current.TryGetResource, in a throwaway [AvaloniaFact].
-->
<Styles xmlns="https://github.com/avaloniaui"
		xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
		xmlns:fluent="clr-namespace:Avalonia.Themes.Fluent;assembly=Avalonia.Themes.Fluent">
	<Design.PreviewWith>
		<ScrollViewer Background="AliceBlue" HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Auto">
			<!-- Root container with a neutral background and proper padding -->
			<Border Padding="30"  CornerRadius="8" Classes="KuwantimaGlass" MinWidth="400">
				<StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="40">

					<!-- LIGHT PREVIEW -->
					<ThemeVariantScope RequestedThemeVariant="Light">
						<Border CornerRadius="8" BoxShadow="0 4 10 0 #40000000"
								Background="{DynamicResource SystemRegionBrush}" MinWidth="400" Padding="20">
							<StackPanel Spacing="20">
								<TextBlock Text="Kuwantima Primary (Light)"
										   FontWeight="Bold" FontSize="18"
										   Foreground="{DynamicResource SystemAccentColor}" />

								<StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="15">
									<Button Content="Primary Accent" Classes="accent" />
									<Button Content="Standard" />
									<Button Classes="Kuwantima" Content="Kuwantima" />
								</StackPanel>

								<Separator Background="{DynamicResource SystemBaseLowColor}" Height="1" />

								<UniformGrid Columns="3">
									<StackPanel Spacing="5" HorizontalAlignment="Center">
										<Ellipse Width="40" Height="40" Fill="{DynamicResource SystemFillColorSuccessBrush}" />
										<TextBlock Text="Success" HorizontalAlignment="Center" FontSize="10" Foreground="{DynamicResource SystemBaseHighColor}"/>
									</StackPanel>
									<StackPanel Spacing="5" HorizontalAlignment="Center">
										<Ellipse Width="40" Height="40" Fill="{DynamicResource SystemFillColorAttentionBrush}" />
										<TextBlock Text="Attention" HorizontalAlignment="Center" FontSize="10" Foreground="{DynamicResource SystemBaseHighColor}"/>
									</StackPanel>
									<StackPanel Spacing="5" HorizontalAlignment="Center">
										<Ellipse Width="40" Height="40" Fill="{DynamicResource SystemFillColorCautionBrush}" />
										<TextBlock Text="Caution" HorizontalAlignment="Center" FontSize="10" Foreground="{DynamicResource SystemBaseHighColor}"/>
									</StackPanel>
								</UniformGrid>
							</StackPanel>
						</Border>
					</ThemeVariantScope>

					<!-- DARK PREVIEW -->
					<ThemeVariantScope RequestedThemeVariant="Dark">
						<Border CornerRadius="8" Classes="KuwantimaGlass" MinWidth="400" Padding="20">
							<StackPanel Spacing="20">
								<TextBlock Text="Kuwantima Primary (Dark)"
										   FontWeight="Bold" FontSize="18"
										   Foreground="{DynamicResource SystemAccentColor}" />

								<StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="15">
									<Button Content="Primary Accent" Classes="accent" />
									<Button Content="Standard" />
									<Button Classes="Kuwantima" Content="Kuwantima" />
								</StackPanel>

								<Separator Background="{DynamicResource SystemBaseLowColor}" Height="1" />

								<UniformGrid Columns="3">
									<StackPanel Spacing="5" HorizontalAlignment="Center">
										<Ellipse Width="40" Height="40" Fill="{DynamicResource SystemFillColorSuccessBrush}" />
										<TextBlock Text="Success" HorizontalAlignment="Center" FontSize="10" Foreground="{DynamicResource SystemBaseHighColor}"/>
									</StackPanel>
									<StackPanel Spacing="5" HorizontalAlignment="Center">
										<Ellipse Width="40" Height="40" Fill="{DynamicResource SystemFillColorAttentionBrush}" />
										<TextBlock Text="Attention" HorizontalAlignment="Center" FontSize="10" Foreground="{DynamicResource SystemBaseHighColor}"/>
									</StackPanel>
									<StackPanel Spacing="5" HorizontalAlignment="Center">
										<Ellipse Width="40" Height="40" Fill="{DynamicResource SystemFillColorCautionBrush}" />
										<TextBlock Text="Caution" HorizontalAlignment="Center" FontSize="10" Foreground="{DynamicResource SystemBaseHighColor}"/>
									</StackPanel>
								</UniformGrid>
							</StackPanel>
						</Border>
					</ThemeVariantScope>

				</StackPanel>
			</Border>
		</ScrollViewer>
	</Design.PreviewWith>


	<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
	<!-- 1. MERGED RESOURCES                                               -->
	<!--    Icons and theme-aware brush/shadow definitions loaded before    -->
	<!--    any control style so all DynamicResource keys resolve.         -->
	<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
	<Styles.Resources>
		<ResourceDictionary>
			<ResourceDictionary.MergedDictionaries>

				<ResourceInclude Source="avares://Kuwantima/Styles/KuwantimaStreamIcons.axaml"/>
				<ResourceInclude Source="avares://Kuwantima/Theme/KuwantimaThemeResources.axaml"/>

			</ResourceDictionary.MergedDictionaries>

		</ResourceDictionary>
	</Styles.Resources>

	<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
	<!-- 2. CONTROL STYLES                                                 -->
	<!--    Each file defines one or more Kuwantima-classed style variants -->
	<!--    for a single Avalonia control.  Applied via Classes="Kuwantima" -->
	<!--    (and optional variant classes like Classic, Accent, Pill, etc.) -->
	<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->

	<StyleInclude Source="avares://Kuwantima/Styles/KuwantimaButton.axaml"/>
	<StyleInclude Source="avares://Kuwantima/Styles/KuwantimaCheckBox.axaml"/>
	<StyleInclude Source="avares://Kuwantima/Styles/KuwantimaComboBox.axaml"/>
	<StyleInclude Source="avares://Kuwantima/Styles/KuwantimaExpander.axaml"/>
	<StyleInclude Source="avares://Kuwantima/Styles/KuwantimaGlassBorder.axaml"/>
	<StyleInclude Source="avares://Kuwantima/Styles/KuwantimaListBox.axaml"/>
	<StyleInclude Source="avares://Kuwantima/Styles/KuwantimaMenuToggleButton.axaml"/>
	<StyleInclude Source="avares://Kuwantima/Styles/KuwantimaRadioButton.axaml"/>
	<StyleInclude Source="avares://Kuwantima/Styles/KuwantimaTextBox.axaml"/>
	<StyleInclude Source="avares://Kuwantima/Styles/KuwantimaToggleButton.axaml"/>
	<StyleInclude Source="avares://Kuwantima/Styles/KuwantimaSlider.axaml"/>
	<StyleInclude Source="avares://Kuwantima/Styles/KuwantimaProgressBar.axaml"/>
	<StyleInclude Source="avares://Kuwantima/Styles/KuwantimaTabControl.axaml"/>
	<StyleInclude Source="avares://Kuwantima/Styles/KuwantimaToolTip.axaml"/>
	<StyleInclude Source="avares://Kuwantima/Styles/KuwantimaGridSplitter.axaml"/>

	<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
	<!-- 3. FLUENT PALETTE                                                 -->
	<!--    Overrides Avalonia's built-in FluentTheme ColorPaletteResources -->
	<!--    so that EVERY Fluent control (styled or unstyled) inherits the  -->
	<!--    Kuwantima color story.                                         -->
	<!--                                                                   -->
	<!--    Base*   = text color hierarchy (high→low = bold→subtle)         -->
	<!--    Alt*    = background layer hierarchy (high = nearest surface)   -->
	<!--    Chrome* = borders, dividers, scrollbars, subtle UI chrome      -->
	<!--    List*   = selection/hover highlights inside list-like controls  -->
	<!--                                                                   -->
	<!--    LIGHT uses MidnightBlue-tinted values (blue-ink feel).         -->
	<!--    DARK  uses AliceBlue-tinted values (icy-frost feel).           -->
	<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
	<fluent:FluentTheme>
		<fluent:FluentTheme.Palettes>

			<!-- LIGHT: MidnightBlue ink on AliceBlue paper ─────────────── -->
			<fluent:ColorPaletteResources x:Key="Light"
										  Accent="#0078D4"
										  ErrorText="#E81123"
										  RegionColor="#F3F3F3"

										  BaseHigh="#191970"
										  BaseMediumHigh="#3D3D80"
										  BaseMedium="#6A6A9E"
										  BaseMediumLow="#9090B0"
										  BaseLow="#F0F8FF"

										  AltHigh="#FFFFFF"
										  AltMediumHigh="#FAFCFF"
										  AltMedium="#F4F8FF"
										  AltMediumLow="#F0F4FF"
										  AltLow="#EAF0FC"

										  ChromeHigh="#C4C4D8"
										  ChromeMedium="#D4D4E4"
										  ChromeMediumLow="#DDDDE9"
										  ChromeLow="#E5E5EE"
										  ChromeDisabledHigh="#BDBDCF"
										  ChromeDisabledLow="#E0E0EC"

										  ChromeAltLow="#191970"
										  ChromeBlackHigh="#191970"
										  ChromeBlackMedium="#3D3D80"
										  ChromeBlackMediumLow="#6A6A9E"
										  ChromeBlackLow="#C4C4D8"
										  ChromeWhite="#FFFFFF"

										  ListLow="#E6E8F2"
										  ListMedium="#D2D6E6" />

			<!-- DARK: AliceBlue frost on deep blue-black ────────────────── -->
			<fluent:ColorPaletteResources x:Key="Dark"
										  Accent="#0078D4"
										  ErrorText="#F1707A"
										  RegionColor="#1C1C1C"

										  BaseHigh="#F0F8FF"
										  BaseMediumHigh="#CCD6EE"
										  BaseMedium="#A0B4D0"
										  BaseMediumLow="#7088A8"
										  BaseLow="#191970"

										  AltHigh="#1A1A2E"
										  AltMediumHigh="#1E1E34"
										  AltMedium="#22223A"
										  AltMediumLow="#282842"
										  AltLow="#F0F8FF"

										  ChromeHigh="#3A3A55"
										  ChromeMedium="#333348"
										  ChromeMediumLow="#2E2E42"
										  ChromeLow="#28283C"
										  ChromeDisabledHigh="#404058"
										  ChromeDisabledLow="#2A2A3E"

										  ChromeAltLow="#F0F8FF"
										  ChromeBlackHigh="#000000"
										  ChromeBlackMedium="#1A1A2E"
										  ChromeBlackMediumLow="#2A2A44"
										  ChromeBlackLow="#3A3A55"
										  ChromeWhite="#F0F8FF"

										  ListLow="#252540"
										  ListMedium="#30304E" />

		</fluent:FluentTheme.Palettes>
	</fluent:FluentTheme>

	<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
	<!-- 4. GLOBAL DEFAULTS                                                -->
	<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
	<Style Selector="PathIcon">
		<Setter Property="Width" Value="20" />
		<Setter Property="Height" Value="20" />
	</Style>

</Styles>
